  "description": "Itsy Bitsy is a spider-themed playground in Cherry Red. Spider legs form the climbing frame, a hanging bridge crosses to a red tower, and a spiral slide brings children down onto a blue web-pattern surface in one installation. There is also a spider web net, a sideways balancing bar and pretend play panels. It suits ages 5 to 12 and takes up to 15 children. At 36'3\" x 9'6\", it is the longest piece in our Khel-Khud collection, with a safe play area of 42'3\" x 15'6\". Climbing, hanging, balancing and sliding here build gross motor skills and balance. The main materials carry a 3-year warranty. Send us your site photos and we will plan the layout.",
